  "description": "Kwon Chang-woon was off to a great start at the cosmetic company he was just hired at. Raving reviews from his coworkers, getting recognized by Park Young-in, the team leader and rising star at the company, things couldn’t have been going any better… until an alcohol abundant, rowdy work dinner complicates matters. Young-in has too much to drink and when Chang-woon helps him get home, he opens Young-in’s closet and discovers a major secret, one involving silk… \n\n(Source: Lezhin US) \n\n*Chapter count includes a prologue*",
